// error: what is passed for `body` of `Mutex.with` is isolated, so nothing it runs may reach module-level mutable state, but it reaches `cache`, a module-level `var`, which every thread would share; share it through an `Atomic` or a `Mutex` held in a `val`
// error: what is passed for `body` of `Mutex.with` is isolated, so nothing it runs may reach module-level mutable state, but it reaches `kept`, a module-level value holding a `Buffer[Buffer[int]]`, which is mutable; an immutable copy (`toVector`) is sendable
// error: what is passed for `body` of `Mutex.with` is isolated, so nothing it runs may reach module-level mutable state, but it reaches `keep`, a module-level value holding a `(Buffer[int]) -> unit`, which is a function value, whose type does not say what it captures
// error: what is passed for `body` of `Mutex.with` is isolated, so nothing it runs may reach module-level mutable state, but it reaches the object `Store`, whose field `items` holds a `Buffer[Buffer[int]]`, which is mutable; an immutable copy (`toVector`) is sendable
// error: what is passed for `f` of `guarded` is isolated, so nothing it runs may reach module-level mutable state, but it reaches `cache`, a module-level `var`, which every thread would share; share it through an `Atomic` or a `Mutex` held in a `val`
// A mutex's body may not leave the value it guards where code that does not take the lock reaches
// it: stored in a module-level `var`, added to a module-level collection, handed to a closure kept at
// module level, put away by a method of a module-level object, or any of these through a program's
// own generic function that passes an `@isolating` body on to `with`.
import avin.threads.Mutex

var cache = Buffer[int]()
val kept = Buffer[Buffer[int]]()
val keep: (Buffer[int]) -> unit = b -> kept.addOne(b)

object Store
  val items = Buffer[Buffer[int]]()
  put(b: Buffer[int]) = items.addOne(b)

guarded[T, R: Sendable](m: Mutex[T], @isolating f: (T) -> R) -> R = m.with(f)

main()
  val m = Mutex(Buffer[int]())
  m.with(b -> cache = b)
  m.with(b -> kept.addOne(b))
  m.with(b -> keep(b))
  m.with(b -> Store.put(b))
  guarded(m, b -> cache = b)
